.TH XD\-FOLDERS 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-folders \- Folder Options
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-folders
.OP \-\-view view
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-folders
is Windows XP's Folder Options (Control Panel; Tools > Folder Options in
.BR xd\-files (1)):
.TP
.B General
Open each folder in the same window or its own, and whether what would
open a new window from a folder window (its own window, a new network
place or drive) opens a new tab in it instead; single- or double-click to
open an item.
.TP
.B View
Apply to All Folders and Reset All Folders, and the advanced settings.
.TP
.B File Types
The file types by extension and the program each opens with; Change...
sets the default.
New and Delete change the user's MIME database.
.PP
The settings go to
.IR desktop.ini ,
which
.B xd\-files
follows at once; the programs files open with go to GIO's
.IR mimeapps.list .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-view= view
The view of the folder Folder Options was opened from
.RB ( Thumbnails ", " Tiles ", " Icons ", " List " or " Details ),
for Apply to All Folders; without it, that button is greyed.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a summary of the options and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/xeondesktop/desktop.ini
.BR [Folders] .
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/mimeapps.list
Default applications.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/mime/packages/
New file types, compiled by
.BR update\-mime\-database (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xd\-files (1),
.BR xd\-defaults (1),
.BR update\-mime\-database (1)
